- Based in: Pakistan
- Product categories: Electronics & Gadgets, Fashion & Apparel, Beauty & Personal Care, Home & Kitchen, Health & Fitness
- Payment methods: Credit cards, Debit cards, Cash on Delivery (COD)
- Shipping: Standard delivery within 3-5 business days
- Returns: 30-day return policy for unused items in original packaging
"""

PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.9